{"sectionId":"metabolism/etc","items":[{"id":"metabolism--etc-k001","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"미토콘드리아 내막의 복합체 I은 NADH 전자를 ubiquinone(Q)에, 복합체 II는 succinate 산화에서 나온 전자를 Q에 전달한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k002","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Q→복합체 III→cytochrome c→복합체 IV→O₂ 순서로 전달되며 O₂는 물로 환원된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k003","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"I, III, IV는 양성자를 기질에서 막사이공간으로 이동시키고 II는 펌프하지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k004","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"기질 쪽으로 돌아오는 H⁺의 전기화학적 기울기가 F₀F₁ ATP 합성효소를 구동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k005","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Rotenone은 I, antimycin A는 III, cyanide와 CO는 IV를 억제한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k006","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Oligomycin은 ATP 합성효소의 양성자 통로를 막아 기울기가 커지면서 호흡도 느려진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k007","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"DNP와 UCP1 같은 짝풀림 기작은 기울기를 소산해 ATP 합성 효율을 낮추고 열 생산을 증가시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k008","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"산소 소비는 기질 공급 및 억제 위치에 따라 달라지므로 실험 조건을 함께 해석해야 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k009","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"NADH당 ATP 약 2.5, FAD 환원당량당 약 1.5(통상 근사).","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k010","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"복합체 I·III·IV 펌프, II 비펌프.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k011","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"짝풀림은 전자전달계 억제와 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k012","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"포도당 완전 산화 ATP 수율은 셔틀과 막 누출에 따라 달라지며 흔히 30~32이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--etc-k013","sectionId":"metabolism/etc","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"복합체 II에서 Q로 전자를 전달하여 I을 우회하기 때문이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}